  "details": "First things first, not a major bug, not even really a problem but still something to document so here.\nok long story short is the subject and here are the details, while trying to test my map in a live format i use launch parameters directly on the exe through a shortcut for example:\n\"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\VRChat\\VRChat.exe\" --enable-debug-gui --profile=0 --no-vr\nand no launch, yet if i launch from steam all is ok, just no parameters, and yes i know how to do parameters for steam launch i just want more options.\nanyways this keep going till i noticed my usb xbox 360 controller plugged in.\nunplugged it and it works fine. to clarify i was in task manager too so when it was not working both the crash handler and vrchat appeared and stacked up for how many times i tried to launch it with the controller plugged in but no window ever appeared.\nthat is it.",
